---
title: "repay - Repay Borrowed Assets (Scallop Lending)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_version_check: check version matches
    q_version_check --> q_check_lock: version valid
    q_version_check --> q_error_version: version mismatch
    q_error_version --> [*]: revert

    q_check_lock --> q_accrue_interest: obligation not locked
    q_check_lock --> q_error_locked: obligation locked
    q_error_locked --> [*]: revert 770

    q_accrue_interest --> q_calc_debt: compound_interest(market, clock)
    q_calc_debt --> q_calc_repay: current_debt = obligation.debts[T] (with accrued interest)
    q_calc_repay --> q_determine_amount: repay_amount = min(user_coin.value, current_debt)

    q_determine_amount --> q_update_debt: apply repayment
    q_update_debt --> q_update_pool: obligation.debts[T] -= repay_amount
    q_update_pool --> q_split_interest: pool.available += repay_amount
    q_split_interest --> q_check_remaining: protocol_income += interest_portion * borrow_interest_fee_rate
    q_check_remaining --> q_refund: if user_coin.value > current_debt
    q_check_remaining --> q_emit_full: user_coin.value <= current_debt
    q_refund --> [*]: emit RepayEventV3, refund excess to sender
    q_emit_full --> [*]: emit RepayEventV3

    note right of q_calc_repay
        INV-001: repay_amount <= user_coin.value (never takes more than provided)
        INV-002: repay_amount <= current_debt (never over-repays)
    end note

    note right of q_update_debt
        INV-003: obligation.debts[T] after = obligation.debts[T] before - repay_amount
        INV-004: obligation.debts[T] >= 0 after repayment
        INV-005: no ObligationKey required (anyone can repay on behalf of borrower)
    end note
